# Allowed scopes. Used only when read_policy.txt says "allowlist" (or the
# hardened wrapper enforces allowlist mode). In that mode nothing is visible
# unless it matches an entry below; the blocklist still takes precedence.
#
#   area:<name or id>
#   project:<name or id>
#   tag:<name or id>
#   unfiled                to-dos that belong to no project and no area
#                          (needed to read the Inbox or add unfiled to-dos)
#
# Examples:
# area:Work
# project:Kitchen Renovation
# tag:Errands
# unfiled
